<title>UK: Nat Power, PowerGen rally.</title>
<headline>Nat Power, PowerGen rally.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in National Power Plc and PowerGen Plc rose on Friday as bargain-hunters emerged after their recent sharp declines, dealers said.</p>
<p>&quot;It is really just because of the fall they've had, they are just coming back from that,&quot; said one market-maker.</p>
<p>National Power shares were up 11-1/2p at 513 by 0935 GMT in volume of just under one million shares while PowerGen was up 10p at 666 in volume of 385,551.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
